  "description": "Systembeteckningar (system designations) written on ritningar next to the pipe dimension. Format: <systembeteckning>[index]-<dimension>, e.g. KV-28, VV-15, VVC-12, KV1-35, VS2-40, KB2-50. line_count = number of pipes the designation belongs to; line_count 2 marks a circulating circuit (heat carrier, cold carrier) where framledning and returrör always travel as a pair. Whether that pair is drawn as two lines with the label on only one of them, or as one line covering both, is a property of the sheet rather than of the code: look for a parallel unlabelled twin before deciding whether to copy the label across or to double the measured length. line_count 1 systems (KV, VV, VVC, S, D and the rest) label every drawn pipe individually, so never infer a partner for them.",
